    <div class="side-box message-box emergency-message-box oc-emergency-severity-30 " >
   <h3 class="side-box-title">East Branch Closed On Election Day</h3>
   <div class="side-box-content">
      <p >The East Branch will be closed on Election Day, Tuesday, November 3, 2026. Please click on link below to find an alternate Motor Vehicle Branch. Sorry for the inconvenience.</p>
      <a href="https://www.jeffersoncountyclerk.org/Motor-Vehicle-and-Boat/Location-and-Hours"  target="_self" >Location and Hours</a>
      
   </div>
   
