        <h1 class='oc-page-title '>Sample Ballots</h1>
        
        <p><strong>Louisville &amp; Jefferson County, Kentucky</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p>To find your precinct, districts, and elected representatives, visit the <a href="https://vrsws.sos.ky.gov/vic/" target="_blank">Kentucky Voter Information Center</a>.</p>
<p>Enter your <strong>residential</strong> address.</p>
<p>Abbreviate street directions, (N, S, E, W), and street types, (CIR, DR, ST, etc).</p>
<p><a href="https://strap.jeffersoncountyclerk.org/WhereDoIVote/images/ballots/C124.pdf" target="_self">Sample Ballot</a></p>


      
        
            
        
